<title>USA: Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-Minn direct weekly average hog weights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iowa-Southern Minnesota direct hogs weekly average weights of barrows and gilts for the week ending April 5, 1997, according to the USDA.</p>
<p>Iowa-So Minnesota direct hogs    Receipts   Average Weight/lbs</p>
<p>week ending:  4-5-97		  327000	    253.1</p>
<p>week ending:  3-28-97		 352000	    253.1</p>
<p>year ago:     4-6-1996		353000	    247.9</p>
